<% if @kind == "verification" %>
Verify your email address to activate your Mobility Exchange account:
<%= verification_url(@token) %>
This link expires after 24 hours.
<% elsif @kind == "email_change" %>
Confirm your new Mobility Exchange email address:
<%= profile_email_url(@token) %>
Your current sign-in email stays active until you confirm. This link expires after 24 hours. If you did not request it, ignore this email.
<% else %>
Reset your Mobility Exchange password:
<%= edit_password_reset_url(@token) %>
This link expires after 30 minutes. If you did not request it, you can ignore this email.
<% end %>
